  "description": "First floor rear extension with internal alterations ",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-946dc8f2-7fff-5adc-e56c-fc1dbbcbe03c&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background-color: transparent; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space-collapse: preserve;&quot;&gt;The proposed first floor rear extension, by reason of its unsympathetic scale, bulk, location and detailed design, would comprise an incongruous, discordant and overly-prominent form of development, which would harm the character and appearance of the application property, the wider terrace and the the local area. As such the proposed development is contrary to policy D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) and D4 (Delivering Good Design) of the London Plan 2021, policy LP1 (Design Quality and Local Character) of the Hackney Local Plan 2033, and the REA SPD (2009).&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
